"""Quest item descriptions for the proposed add-on (design stage, NOT original game text).

Key = quest item index n (0..84; DS F077 + n holds the count, DS:24CC[n] the original name).
Each entry: id (facts.json unit), world, text variants and the evidence the text rests on.
  'text'              one description (always shown)
  'before' / 'after'  two descriptions; 'after' is shown while QUEST's bit is set
                      (F06F bit n+1 of quest list entry n; quest-NN = list entry NN-1)
  'quest'             the quest unit whose bit selects the variant
  'why'               the original sites the text is written from (facts.json refs, aaze texts)
No coordinates on purpose; places and people are named as the game's own texts name them.
"""

